  m_Name: Lesson 13 Question 0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Why is Jesus a better priest than even all the Old Testament priest?
  answers:
  - He is sinless
  - He uses better tools
  - He is smarter
  - He is taller than all of them
  correctAnswerIndex: 0
  discussionAnswer: Jesus is the better high priest because he is sinless.  All other
    priests were tempted and failed at some point, but Jesus was tempted in every
    respect yet remained perfect.
